b json.de(fs.read proc.args[0|fn cents s|int(s>>replace".""<fn money c|"{c//100}.{c%100:0>2}<bal(b.accounts>>map a=>a.id,(cents a.balance)>>dict|st{applied:0 insufficient:0 failed:0 retries:0|error Transient|fn apply t|amt cents t.amount|if amt>bal[t.from|st.insufficient+=1|^<bal[t.from]-=amt|bal[t.to]+=amt|st.applied+=1<async fn run t!Transient|await sleep t.delay|for att 0..4|try|if t.transient>att|!Transient<apply t|^<catch Transient|if att==3|st.failed+=1|^<st.retries+=1<<<b.transfers>>map run>>all>>await|for id,c bal|if c>0|bal[id]=c+(c+50)//100<<out["applied: $st.applied""insufficient: $st.insufficient""failed: $st.failed""retries: $st.retries|for id bal.keys>>sort|out.push"$id {money bal[id]}<print(out>>join"\n